WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.950
Water And Food. About 4 liters of water per person per day and 3 days of non-perishable food.

00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:09.950
First Aid And Medicines. Bandages, antiseptic, gloves, masks and a 7-day supply of prescription medicines.

00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:14.950
Light And Radio. Flashlight, spare batteries, a battery or crank radio and a power bank.

00:00:15.000 --> 00:00:19.950
Documents And Cash. Copies of IDs and records in a waterproof bag, with some cash in small bills.

00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:24.950
Think Of Everyone. Add baby supplies, eyeglasses, mobility aids and pet food if you need them.

